{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/801541-convince-me-that-protocol-is-aught-but-irrelevant-to-adventuring-pc-s","id":801541,"title":"Convince me that Protocol is aught but irrelevant to adventuring PC's.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-05T12:03:11-08:00","id":801541,"title":"Convince me that Protocol is aught but irrelevant to adventuring PC's.","content":"it feels like a &quot;Blank purchase&quot; For most PC's not unlike many &quot;Blank&quot; charms in exalted , 1st edition in particular, where you buy it SOLELY in order to purchase other powers down the road...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T15:38:07-08:00","id":801637,"title":"","content":"Well, it's a really useful power to use in a social situation when you want to impose your view on your interlocutors and to assure your domination and your innate advantage. The problem is that the PCs are more likely to be on the receiving end of such a cantrip if they are the ones who are the visitors. Also it's far more likely that the foes the PCs would like to impress with their social acumen would be more titled than them. Also it's a power who always seems a little invasive if you want to enter negotiations on friendly terms. So yeah, it's not as useful for everyone as could be Fuddle or Gimmix.<br /> <br /> I agree that Protocol have a problem, but for me it's just that this cantrip needs really to be able to work outside the Seelie Sidhe perspective. Eshus, Korred, Sluaghs, Trolls, Unseelie Sidhes, here comes a huge bunch of faes who have their own sets of alien rules and complex traditions and that should be able to impose their laws to mortals, Prodigals and other faeries of equal or lesser status.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","name":"DaemonChrno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T02:48:24-08:00","id":801898,"title":"","content":"Protocol is great. Use it to stop people fighting, to stop people speaking louder than a whisper, to stop people disagreeing, to stop people walking, to stop people leaving. It has lots of uses.<br /> <br /> I ignore the Second Edition rule that it can't be used with Prop and allow it to be used to prevent objects from intruding upon proceedings as well (the volume won't go up on TVs, knives won't cut). <br /> <br /> It is a step power (Dictum and Ban/Geas cover a lot of the same ground), but it's absolutely useful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}